flag provided but not defined: -nope
Usage of soak:
  -cpuprofile string
    	write a CPU profile of the whole run to this file
  -duration duration
    	total run time (default 1m0s)
  -endpoint string
    	relay endpoint: semaphore-eval | semaphore-allflags | ofrep-eval | ofrep-bulk (default "semaphore-eval")
  -exporter string
    	discard | slow | failing (default "discard")
  -flag string
    	flag key to evaluate (tracking on by default) (default "rule-bool-track")
  -flush-ms int
    	exporter flush interval (ms) (default 100)
  -heap-tolerance float
    	relative HeapInuse growth tolerated (default 0.25)
  -interval duration
    	sampling interval (default 5s)
  -max-events int
    	exporter MaxEventInMemory (a small backlog keeps the heap measuring leaks, not the pending events) (default 10000)
  -protocol string
    	relay client and server protocol: http1 (keep-alive) | h2c (HTTP/2 cleartext) (default "http1")
  -target string
    	library | relay (default "library")
  -warmup int
    	warm-up samples ignored by the verdict (default max(2, 20%))
  -workers int
    	number of load goroutines (default <GOMAXPROCS>)
